# editlib: text being edited, for any program with somewhere to type. The caret, what's
# selected, moving by characters, words and lines, typing and deleting, undo and redo, and
# finding, on text of any length, in UTF-8. It draws nothing and reads no keys: the program
# using it does both, and turns its keys and clicks into EdText's calls.
#
#   phi build editlib.phi --library      # editlib.philib, which a program includes with `use editlib;`
#
# README.md says which names are its API.

use editlib.text;

phi.EditLib:Library
{
	const int VERSION: 1;

	# Call this once, before anything else in the library. There's nothing to set up yet, but a
	# program that calls it keeps working when there is.
	[Start]
	[end]
}
